# Present so that Xposed implementations with a "modern" (libxposed) module
# detection path recognise this APK as a module WITHOUT having to read the
# legacy xposedminversion meta-data.
#
# IMPORTANT: `targetApiVersion` is deliberately absent, and must stay absent.
#
# Vector decides how to LOAD a module from this file and assets/xposed_init,
# not from the detection markers (FileSystem.loadModule):
#
#     targetApi >= 101 -> MODERN
#     assets/xposed_init present -> LEGACY      <- this module
#     targetApi == 100 -> UNSUPPORTED
#     else -> NONE
#
# but it decides whether the package IS a module from either the legacy
# meta-data OR the mere presence of META-INF/xposed/java_init.list
# (ModuleDetection.inspect). Declaring targetApiVersion here would move the
# loader onto the MODERN branch and break a module that implements the legacy
# de.robv.android.xposed API and nothing else.
minApiVersion=93
name=FanQieNovelCrack
description=番茄小说 v7.3.5.32 课程样本：破解会员 / 去除广告 / 无限时长自动阅读（仅对 com.dragon.read 生效）
